Cell["\<\
To compare the Liouville superoperators obtained using the algebraic and \
standard Kronecker product methods, we subtract one superoperator from the \
other.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0017711815478773`*^9, 
  4.001771224220129*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"965dc608-b1de-416b-97f9-\
c59e630a3140"],

